# CloudSuite in-memory-analytics (Tier-B, C32/C33): Spark ALS movie
# recommendation, a BATCH job — it is its own load (no load.sh / load-client).
# `restart: always` loops the job so the run window sees continuous pressure;
# the brief restart gaps are inherent to the workload class and noted in C33.
# The movielens dataset is the external volume `intp-cs-movielens`,
# provisioned once by the installer.
COMPOSE_FILES="compose.yml"
ANCHOR_SERVICE="analytics"
READY_TIMEOUT=120
SETUP_HINT="bench/setup/setup-cloudsuite-workload.sh"
